      "content": "I'll read both the original test and the CUT source to understand the context before improving understandability.Now I have a clear picture. I'll improve understandability by:\n1. Removing all unused imports\n2. Fixing the misplaced `// Long.MAX_VALUE` comment (it was after the wrong property)\n3. Using descriptive property key names instead of `Seconds1`/`Seconds2`\n4. Adding brief inline comments to clarify each assertion's intentThe improved test compiled successfully. The changes made: removed 9 unused imports, renamed opaque property keys (`Seconds1`/`Seconds2`) to self-documenting constants (`ONE_SECOND_KEY`/`MAX_SECONDS_KEY`), moved the misplaced `// Long.MAX_VALUE` comment to the correct property annotation, and added a brief inline comment per assertion to explain the intent of each case."
